  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "dialogue-opening-01",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "쉬는 시간이 끝났어요. 그런데 교실이 엉망이에요. 과자와 종이가 여기저기 있어요.",
      "category": "narration",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "opening",
      "actId": null,
      "index": 0,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-opening-01.mp3",
      "sha256": "f58ee84499698dacb9a38fc2d3351801abbc2488212ead0c31a1b8c362b68f3a",
      "bytes": 94508,
      "durationSeconds": 7.778,
      "peakDbfs": -2.87,
      "rmsDbfs": -20.01
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-opening-02",
      "speaker": "mongle",
      "text": "어? 복도에서 발소리가 들려! 누가 오는 걸까?",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "opening",
      "actId": null,
      "index": 1,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-opening-02.mp3",
      "sha256": "90a46c3d185c0e7ebbca77f2cfecd56af6822d0260b57e0f5e310ddef2655c29",
      "bytes": 54764,
      "durationSeconds": 4.487,
      "peakDbfs": -2.99,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.1
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-opening-03",
      "speaker": "kkamong",
      "text": "이 몸이 금방 치울 수 있어. …그런데 발소리가 점점 가까워지는데?",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "opening",
      "actId": null,
      "index": 2,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-opening-03.mp3",
      "sha256": "c6734df2dbe6e87799c4a40b1dca68a05713604cafac14eef32ab5207eb0c079",
      "bytes": 68012,
      "durationSeconds": 5.586,
      "peakDbfs": -2.97,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.77
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-opening-04",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "text": "어머나, 교실이 왜 이렇게 됐어?",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "opening",
      "actId": null,
      "index": 3,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-opening-04.mp3",
      "sha256": "9849c8cfc06d12437fc689d436971cf881b6f0e58cb94613e4eb79903180e326",
      "bytes": 42380,
      "durationSeconds": 3.451,
      "peakDbfs": -2.67,
      "rmsDbfs": -18.75
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-opening-05",
      "speaker": "marin",
      "text": "상황 보고. 선생님 도착. 교실 상태, 엉망. …정리를 시작한다.",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "opening",
      "actId": null,
      "index": 4,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-opening-05.mp3",
      "sha256": "25d020d5fc9ec7daedfa022623c6fffd2adbd359eefa99734b65a4e01fe360ef",
      "bytes": 89036,
      "durationSeconds": 7.323,
      "peakDbfs": -2.96,
      "rmsDbfs": -18.33
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-cleanup-intro-01",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "text": "마린, 까몽! 수업 전에 교실부터 정리하자.",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "intro",
      "actId": "cleanup",
      "index": 0,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-cleanup-intro-01.mp3",
      "sha256": "865effe850bc8e5ba4d793486c6120de8aafdecc37e106fb1f0616035b4efe62",
      "bytes": 56204,
      "durationSeconds": 4.597,
      "peakDbfs": -3.2,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.59
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-cleanup-intro-02",
      "speaker": "mongle",
      "text": "어? 이 종이에 뭐가 쓰여 있어! 이것도 버려야 해?",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "intro",
      "actId": "cleanup",
      "index": 1,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-cleanup-intro-02.mp3",
      "sha256": "04b20e8aab7f39f6204f7a87a4750b17b50dee93f716ed2fa8d0fc219a672035",
      "bytes": 63692,
      "durationSeconds": 5.219,
      "peakDbfs": -3.65,
      "rmsDbfs": -18.99
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-cleanup-intro-03",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "text": "아니, 그 종이는 버리면 안 돼. 오늘 쓸 장식이거든.",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [
        "cleanup-paper"
      ],
      "phase": "intro",
      "actId": "cleanup",
      "index": 2,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-cleanup-intro-03.mp3",
      "sha256": "d04cb05444679f5e2865b8af2f58968a16d9a66b24ecab4afe6abb3a102c5471",
      "bytes": 61964,
      "durationSeconds": 5.067,
      "peakDbfs": -5.33,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.44
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-cleanup-outro-01",
      "speaker": "kkamong",
      "text": "봤지? 이 몸이 치우니까 금방이잖아. …종이도 하나도 안 구겼어.",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "outro",
      "actId": "cleanup",
      "index": 0,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-cleanup-outro-01.mp3",
      "sha256": "e45eeb58a58ea89ce63b025a97fb0858dbdb0b834a41f413ee3ddbf8857a40dc",
      "bytes": 74924,
      "durationSeconds": 6.157,
      "peakDbfs": -2.91,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.7
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-cleanup-outro-02",
      "speaker": "marin",
      "text": "정리 완료. 종이 보관. …종이에서 하트 모양 발견.",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "outro",
      "actId": "cleanup",
      "index": 1,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-cleanup-outro-02.mp3",
      "sha256": "997f008dfea477ab264edb0f09eb3d6fd3e6f2d061a2c64a4c1a275e3fc8f339",
      "bytes": 70028,
      "durationSeconds": 5.755,
      "peakDbfs": -2.94,
      "rmsDbfs": -18.21
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-cleanup-outro-03",
      "speaker": "mongle",
      "text": "우와! 하트랑 별이야! 누가 이걸 만들었을까?",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "outro",
      "actId": "cleanup",
      "index": 2,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-cleanup-outro-03.mp3",
      "sha256": "c374dcdee255ada313c4e7ee64aec3f49b1e8a281a03d5cd9332c210c1e004de",
      "bytes": 57068,
      "durationSeconds": 4.678,
      "peakDbfs": -3.19,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.61
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-clue-intro-01",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "text": "어머, 꽃도 있네? 이 꽃은 어디에 둘까?",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "intro",
      "actId": "clue",
      "index": 0,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-clue-intro-01.mp3",
      "sha256": "52ab19955f77420685f593673d2c31c0fe04c9002bbbcad83769a1e1b09db82b",
      "bytes": 53324,
      "durationSeconds": 4.368,
      "peakDbfs": -2.96,
      "rmsDbfs": -18.64
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-clue-intro-02",
      "speaker": "marin",
      "text": "꽃 확인. 세 송이. 상태 양호. …예쁘다.",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [
        "clue-flowers"
      ],
      "phase": "intro",
      "actId": "clue",
      "index": 1,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-clue-intro-02.mp3",
      "sha256": "2f797b2ae0f43639020fd50df462f297d6940001eb176ac1c27ebe55eeacf037",
      "bytes": 58508,
      "durationSeconds": 4.799,
      "peakDbfs": -2.96,
      "rmsDbfs": -18.83
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-clue-intro-03",
      "speaker": "mongle",
      "text": "어? 서랍에 편지가 있어! 누가 쓴 걸까?",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "intro",
      "actId": "clue",
      "index": 2,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-clue-intro-03.mp3",
      "sha256": "5de70455b6b591dfb588ea24562dcc442bb5542f52307e627c09f9239b995463",
      "bytes": 55916,
      "durationSeconds": 4.572,
      "peakDbfs": -2.88,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.11
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-clue-outro-01",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "편지를 펼쳤어요. “선생님, 생일 축하해요!” 하고 쓰여 있어요.",
      "category": "narration",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "outro",
      "actId": "clue",
      "index": 0,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-clue-outro-01.mp3",
      "sha256": "d4e279e28ec56e171f135dc59f77eefcce7bc335b59b2b8f62c56848403da7d9",
      "bytes": 74924,
      "durationSeconds": 6.155,
      "peakDbfs": -2.85,
      "rmsDbfs": -21.06
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-clue-outro-02",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "text": "어머… 오늘이 내 생일인 걸 어떻게 알았어?",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "outro",
      "actId": "clue",
      "index": 1,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-clue-outro-02.mp3",
      "sha256": "efb466cbe833f7094b0d831ac9e09421eb24a882ae854767da1045c5b5618d6c",
      "bytes": 53900,
      "durationSeconds": 4.408,
      "peakDbfs": -4.23,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.11
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-clue-outro-03",
      "speaker": "kkamong",
      "text": "내가 다 준비했지. …사실 편지는 세 번이나 다시 썼어.",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "outro",
      "actId": "clue",
      "index": 2,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-clue-outro-03.mp3",
      "sha256": "0f922a7b11f5298849f50bf657fb9fd3281714a6da247b5f0bad0be70bbcfced",
      "bytes": 68876,
      "durationSeconds": 5.643,
      "peakDbfs": -2.89,
      "rmsDbfs": -20.62
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-surprise-intro-01",
      "speaker": "mongle",
      "text": "우와! 깜짝 생일 파티였구나! 우리 같이 준비하자!",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "intro",
      "actId": "surprise",
      "index": 0,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-surprise-intro-01.mp3",
      "sha256": "446d3aeef16043b8f238a9a5c329f900c5ecdff289c00eba3f8cef16c3af5557",
      "bytes": 63404,
      "durationSeconds": 5.187,
      "peakDbfs": -3.82,
      "rmsDbfs": -19
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-surprise-intro-02",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "text": "그런데 케이크는 어디 있니?",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "intro",
      "actId": "surprise",
      "index": 1,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-surprise-intro-02.mp3",
      "sha256": "50357a91a1e22db14372ec5767e57e73d17c8824813df375bac07b537ddb4e0f",
      "bytes": 37196,
      "durationSeconds": 3.005,
      "peakDbfs": -3.57,
      "rmsDbfs": -17.88
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-surprise-intro-03",
      "speaker": "kkamong",
      "text": "케이크는 내가 숨겨 뒀지. …한 입만 먹으려다가, 아니, 잘 지켰어.",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [
        "surprise-cake"
      ],
      "phase": "intro",
      "actId": "surprise",
      "index": 2,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-surprise-intro-03.mp3",
      "sha256": "13735e02a96efafad7a509638518fb18f286e90ce3fc06dd3210cff474f57978",
      "bytes": 74348,
      "durationSeconds": 6.108,
      "peakDbfs": -2.96,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.51
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-surprise-outro-01",
      "speaker": "marin",
      "text": "파티 준비 완료. 전원 확인. …선생님, 생일 축하합니다.",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "outro",
      "actId": "surprise",
      "index": 0,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-surprise-outro-01.mp3",
      "sha256": "185f81c3e5c0e92581398abd479d3740104c0c6ee53b029e7639a47902d5c877",
      "bytes": 75212,
      "durationSeconds": 6.18,
      "peakDbfs": -2.9,
      "rmsDbfs": -18.17
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-surprise-outro-02",
      "speaker": "mongle",
      "text": "우와! 우리 교실이 파티장이 됐어!",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "outro",
      "actId": "surprise",
      "index": 1,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-surprise-outro-02.mp3",
      "sha256": "9221a260b34202821a0f36da186d09f8006431976b57b965df25f024d00f4392",
      "bytes": 53324,
      "durationSeconds": 4.351,
      "peakDbfs": -4.72,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.71
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-ending-01",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "text": "교실이 엉망인 줄 알았는데… 다 나를 위한 거였구나. 정말 고마워.",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "ending",
      "actId": null,
      "index": 0,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-ending-01.mp3",
      "sha256": "3b7471c73e5ae01d0fa665913c3c0d77da1660df2902f618c9133a042d78919f",
      "bytes": 69164,
      "durationSeconds": 5.685,
      "peakDbfs": -2.92,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.51
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-ending-02",
      "speaker": "kkamong",
      "text": "훗, 이 몸의 작전이니까. …그래도 네가 도와줘서 다행이야.",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "ending",
      "actId": null,
      "index": 1,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-ending-02.mp3",
      "sha256": "abd4c8bf58c9355872978b72ba502c0e571c6f1ef183a65be95d36b6808f2f9c",
      "bytes": 63692,
      "durationSeconds": 5.229,
      "peakDbfs": -2.94,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.12
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-ending-03",
      "speaker": "mongle",
      "text": "같이 하니까 더 신나! 다음 파티도 같이 준비할까?",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "ending",
      "actId": null,
      "index": 2,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-ending-03.mp3",
      "sha256": "95a3abb8edf38901542ea20e345d2fc1ee39b7a3e2c487fba97ff661854d1d24",
      "bytes": 60812,
      "durationSeconds": 4.979,
      "peakDbfs": -3.02,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.59
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-ending-04",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "text": "파티가 끝나면 다시 치워야겠지? 이번에는 부탁이 조금 달라. 잘 읽어 봐.",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "phase": "ending",
      "actId": null,
      "index": 3,
      "file": "assets/voice/dialogue-ending-04.mp3",
      "sha256": "caf5ec37898344a5bba3d1252c30fed631301718fa1e32d7590572e6042347d1",
      "bytes": 77228,
      "durationSeconds": 6.35,
      "peakDbfs": -2.9,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.33
    },
    {
      "id": "feedback-unavailable-story",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "text": "이야기를 먼저 읽어 볼까요?",
      "category": "feedback",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "file": "assets/voice/feedback-unavailable-story.mp3",
      "sha256": "a3bef240039107f61fb5456013ff4c0d07a087e38089c4de6912893c94571fd0",
      "bytes": 39212,
      "durationSeconds": 3.19,
      "peakDbfs": -2.82,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.02
    },
    {
      "id": "feedback-invalid-destination",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "text": "이 물건은 어디에 놓을까요? 놓을 곳을 눌러 주세요.",
      "category": "feedback",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "file": "assets/voice/feedback-invalid-destination.mp3",
      "sha256": "ae27dc55e2e3165470739c3cf4d2e4d41905c059ddf09e179b8aa62352260b05",
      "bytes": 58508,
      "durationSeconds": 4.793,
      "peakDbfs": -3.79,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.1
    },
    {
      "id": "feedback-selection",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "text": "누가 옮길지, 무엇을 옮길지 먼저 골라 주세요.",
      "category": "feedback",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "file": "assets/voice/feedback-selection.mp3",
      "sha256": "224f9cbfff9c4275b61d4c3f1657467f20bc1bf8c3776186f8ad90538da06e3d",
      "bytes": 56780,
      "durationSeconds": 4.634,
      "peakDbfs": -2.92,
      "rmsDbfs": -18.98
    },
    {
      "id": "feedback-extra-object",
      "speaker": "mongle",
      "text": "어? 그건 부탁에 없는 물건이야! 부탁을 같이 다시 읽어 볼까?",
      "category": "feedback",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "file": "assets/voice/feedback-extra-object.mp3",
      "sha256": "103fd24746a2ad9873f0576dd1eadb779cd337dc573b477c6fb011747b8b5366",
      "bytes": 80396,
      "durationSeconds": 6.623,
      "peakDbfs": -2.97,
      "rmsDbfs": -19.17
    },
    {
      "id": "feedback-help-unavailable",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "text": "이 장면은 정리가 다 끝났어요.",
      "category": "feedback",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "file": "assets/voice/feedback-help-unavailable.mp3",
      "sha256": "f00d236667df7db34ac7b134890a4c24c6393afe87fcc5e39a7737cc0c6f3773",
      "bytes": 38636,
      "durationSeconds": 3.134,
      "peakDbfs": -2.86,
      "rmsDbfs": -18.32
    },
    {
      "id": "feedback-already-marin",
      "speaker": "marin",
      "text": "확인. 그 임무는 이미 완료.",
      "category": "feedback",
      "assistanceMissionIds": [],
      "file": "assets/voice/feedback-already-marin.mp3",
      "sha256": "ab06ecdb62844ccb4c6219dfd813801b514f784dd00d3b3e21be72af915dfb99",
      "bytes": 43820,
      "durationSeconds": 3.559,
      "peakDbfs": -2.92,
      "rmsDbfs": -18.16
    },
    {
      "id": "feedback-already-kkamong",
      "speaker": "kkamong",
      "text": "그건 이 몸이 벌써 끝냈지.",
